EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello,

If you are having trouble getting your Month to date as a PDF, please follow these instructions:

- Log in to your banking website on a desktop

- Right click anywhere on the webpage

- Select "Print" In the browser

- Select "Change Printer"

- Select "Print to PDF"

- Select “Print” (This will save the webpage as a pdf to your selected destination)



Thank you,

{!User.Name} | {!User.Title}

{!Case.Email_Signature_Company__c}

{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}
{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}
P: {!User.Phone} | F: {!User.Fax}
E: {!User.Email}
